# Service-account credentials and private keys.
# Globs rather than an exact filename: a renamed copy (e.g. sa.json,
# custodr-service-account.json) must not become trackable by accident.
*-service-account.json
*serviceAccount*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*

